Spec: Portable public contract values

Platform: C#/.NET10

Purpose:
  Keep normalized application declarations immutable and independent of platform or transport state.

Structure:
  ./ManifestContract.cs: Strict declaration parsing owned by its local contract.

Owns:
  ./LinkGate.Contracts.csproj
  ./Models.cs

References:
  /docs/adr/0001-public-contract-normalization.md
  ./PendingGrantRequest.sdd

Must:
  @AppManifest and nested values expose no public setters or writable collections.
  @AppManifest.ToJson and @ConnectionPolicy.ToJson produce normalized public values without credentials.
  @ContractException.Code is `INVALID_REQUEST`, with a fixed message and no supplied values or nested parser exception.

Must not:
  Depend on Windows UI, Android APIs or the legacy pairing model.

Done when:
  Public values resist collection mutation and preserve the normalized shared-corpus results.
